1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,890
Tembok rumahmu itu dilem pakai batu yang dibakar.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,700
Batu kapur dan tanah liat dibakar di tungku…

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,000
jadi butiran klinker.

4
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:09,000
Digiling bareng sedikit gipsum,

5
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:10,070
biar nggak cepat keras.

6
00:00:10,370 --> 00:00:11,520
Tapi semen bukan beton,

7
00:00:11,770 --> 00:00:12,640
cuma lemnya.

8
00:00:12,950 --> 00:00:14,650
Tambah air, pasir,

9
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:16,450
kerikil, baru jadi beton.

10
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,000
Semen mengeras karena kering?

11
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:18,830
Salah!

12
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:20,430
Ia bereaksi dengan air,

13
00:00:20,730 --> 00:00:22,780
membentuk kristal pengikat.

14
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:23,950
Makanya beton harus disiram.

15
00:00:24,290 --> 00:00:26,410
Kuatnya diuji di umur 28 hari.

16
00:00:26,710 --> 00:00:28,160
Mundur 1.900 tahun…

17
00:00:28,470 --> 00:00:30,780
Romawi sudah pakai kapur dan abu gunung api.

18
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:32,980
Lompat ke tahun 1824:

19
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:34,980
semen modern lahir di Inggris.

20
00:00:35,370 --> 00:00:36,650
Tahun 1910…

21
00:00:37,080 --> 00:00:39,500
pabrik semen pertama Asia Tenggara berdiri di Padang.

22
00:00:39,810 --> 00:00:41,500
Semen itu lem batu buatan.

23
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:43,270
Follow buat fakta rumah berikutnya!
